START
  Create vector v = [1,2,3,4,5]
  Create list l = [1, "R", TRUE]
  Create matrix m = 2x2 matrix

  Perform indexing:
    access v[2]
    access l[2]
    access m[1,2]

  Update:
    change v[3] = 10
    change m[2,2] = 20

  Aggregation:
    sum_v = sum of vector
    mean_m = mean of matrix

  Compare structures:
    Vector = same data type
    List = mixed data types
    Matrix = 2D structured data

  Display results
END
